  <h1 class="research-title">Research Series</h1>
  <p class="ref-lede">Essays on how states rose and fell, how peoples lived without them, and how they ruled, ranked, worshipped, wrote, invented and sang. Each one compares societies across continents and ages and draws on the Institute&#8217;s own profiles and data.</p>
